// Ad and consent ids for the iOS app. Copy to Ads.xcconfig (gitignored) and
// fill in the values from the Appodeal dashboard (Apps > Just My Weather >
// App key) and the InMobi CMP portal (the property's p-code). Both ship in
// the binary, so they are not secrets, but they live here rather than in
// the project so a clone without them builds an app that shows no ads
// (AdsService.swift treats a blank as "no ad path"), and so the release
// scripts can refuse a cut that still carries a placeholder.
//
// Debug builds serve Appodeal test ads regardless of these values
// (Appodeal.setTestingEnabled); the ids still have to be present.
JMW_APPODEAL_APP_KEY = REPLACE_WITH_APPODEAL_APP_KEY
JMW_INMOBI_PCODE = REPLACE_WITH_INMOBI_PCODE
